From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:34:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 132/191] [ae-patch] Offer up to three ranked prompt
 suggestions and step through them with rebindable keys

The prompt-suggestion side call now asks Haiku for up to three clearly
different next messages, best first, in the same single call. Near
duplicates are dropped. session.suggestion carries the ranked list in
suggestions and keeps suggestion as the top guess, so a page loaded
before the change still shows one.

The composer shows a 1/3 counter on the Tab chip. Alt+] and Alt+[ step
through the guesses (matched on the physical key, so Option on a Mac
works), a tap on the counter does the same on a phone, and long guesses
wrap instead of truncating. Settings > Chat gains Suggestion keys to
record other combos, saved per browser.
